   "textLength": 583,
   "text": "How much does Bitbucket Pipelines cost?    Bitbucket Pipelines is included as part of your Bitbucket Cloud plan. You only pay for supplemental build minutes that go beyond the build minutes that are included in your plan each month.\n Free                                         50 min / month included\n Standard                             2500 min / month included\n Premium                         ",
